    development of End-User Products;

(b) modify the Source Code as needed to build, optimize, debug, or adapt your
    own End-User Products or internal development workflow;

(c) publish, distribute, sell, and monetize your compiled End-User Products on
    any platform, bundled with the compiled Runtime Components needed to run
